# Infrastructure Knowledge

## Nodes

### node-01 (Primary)
- Hostname: node-01
- IP: 10.0.0.10
- Role: Primary AI inference, control plane, vector DB
- Services: local LLM runtime, control-plane, vector-db, llm-gateway, web-ui

### node-02 (Secondary Inference)
- IP: 10.0.0.20
- Role: Secondary inference / GPU worker for small models

### node-03 (Database)
- IP: 10.0.0.30
- Role: PostgreSQL, staging, batch processing

## Network
- All nodes on a private subnet (10.0.0.x range)
- Local LLM inference reached via the configured backend URL

## Key Services on node-01
- control-plane: mode authority (AUTONOMOUS / CONTROLLED / ESCALATION_REQUIRED / LOCKDOWN)
- vector-db: vector database for RAG and memory
- llm-gateway: LLM routing layer
- web-ui: chat / console interface
